{"server":"tw","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_02_end","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_02","title":"雨林解毒燉湯","storyCode":"DT-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"ce20c3658168fe7e910b8d820d57cf92bae9960a1c33cb87cc58b47dad9545ee","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"小隊中的其他幾人準備用美食引出行蹤神秘的大祭司幫瑪露希爾解毒，卻沒想到先西精心挑選的主菜“藍色肥鳥”竟是苦尋許久的大祭司。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"我的曬鱗架！我的床！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總覺得瑪露希爾平時都沒有這麼敏捷……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她現在恐怕把我們當成炎龍了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然她現在想的都是法琳，讓我來試試……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾，是我，法琳的哥哥，萊歐斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你根本不是萊歐斯！萊歐斯明明是個能擺出奇怪的姿勢威嚇住巴西利斯克的傢伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這的確是蠻有說服力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這樣，只能透過這種方式證明我的身分了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咯——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯……真的是你……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然真有用？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯！炎龍把法琳吃了，我們要打敗牠，把法琳搶回來，然後復活她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你指著我幹嘛！我哪裡像炎龍？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克&先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她這是怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇！她是不是眼睛打轉，腳步淩亂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"張牙舞爪，胡言亂語？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"口吐白沫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對對對！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"那就沒錯了，她這是中毒了！但同樣幸運又不幸運的是，知道解毒方法的人也只有大祭司！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這裡只有這些卡比比草，通常大家中毒了、生病了、拉肚子了都會吃這個，你們可以先用它救急！但別指望它能有什麼好效果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……我來穩住瑪露希爾，你們都先去找能把大祭司吸引來的東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼找？去哪找？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"做出一頓豐盛的飯，儘快吸引大祭司來就好了！她應該是產生了幻覺，再這樣下去我家就要被炸沒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇爾查克，你們去吧，這裡我能應付！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，瑪露希爾就交給你了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這些魚和樹果老夫覺得一定夠用了……阿達克利斯兄弟，多謝你指路，但可以再麻煩你一件事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"魚？這東西叫鱗啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……原來魚在你們這裡是叫這個名字。但無論如何，請你先回到村子裡，幫我們燒一鍋熱水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"熱水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，老夫剛剛冒出一個新想法，普通的飯菜應該很難快速地把大祭司吸引來，老夫決定做一大鍋湯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一方面是感謝你們對我們的照顧，另一方面，老夫記得你說過，那位大祭司喜歡熱鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"噢！你要做一鍋超美味的湯？好啊！那我就先回去準備了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這些魚和樹果作為配菜是夠用了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，總覺得還差點什麼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪了，感覺到有點奇怪的動靜就過來看看，結果好像也沒什麼特別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛“無敵的酷東西”還突然爆炸了，真倒楣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，算了！回去睡覺好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要不是答應了祖瑪瑪幫她看著這邊的研究，我才不想一個人待在這裡呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"體態飽滿，色彩鮮豔……是隻健康的肥鳥。讓老夫查查《鮑勃的美食指南》看這東西能不能吃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“羽獸，渾身覆蓋著羽毛，能在天上飛，可以吃，很好吃，怎麼做都好吃。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……這樣的食材，作為一鍋湯的主料應該夠格，而且也足夠吸引人，一定能讓大祭司滿意！就是它了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（為什麼有個杜林一副要吃了我的樣子在靠近我？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？嗯嗯？他真的是杜林嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……哦，原來如此，這下子好玩了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，太久沒玩過了，死要怎麼裝來著？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎啊啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……老夫下手應該沒有這麼狠？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——嘎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，只要解決了就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇爾查克！樹果採夠了嗎？我們該回去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungle_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯，為什麼你明明是萊歐斯，我卻覺得你長得有點像炎龍呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾，我們來聊聊有關法琳的事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法琳是我最好的朋友！我跟你說，萊歐斯，法琳真的很喜歡你。我認識她之後，她經常提到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人都覺得她是後段班，但是我不覺得。我從她身上學到了許多東西！我最喜歡她了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是……但是……因為我太弱小了，她就被炎龍……被炎龍吃掉了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這不是你一個人的責任，瑪露希爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法琳是我的妹妹，我不會不管她的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但他還是忍不住有點好奇：在中毒的瑪露希爾眼中，其他人到底是什麼樣的炎龍？\n先西會是矮矮胖胖的炎龍嗎？奇爾查克會很小隻嗎？\n自己要不要也去找一找那個什麼果子吃吃看呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛睡過去了……他們說這也算是一種身體的自我保護，但還是要儘快解毒讓她醒過來才好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！那老夫馬上開始做湯，主料就是這隻肥鳥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望這鍋湯真的能把大祭司請回來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼為了節省時間，來幫老夫準備其他的食材吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看樹林裡風的方向……在背風處生火，免得引發火災。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把樹果、可食用蘑菇還有馬鈴薯都洗乾淨，切成大小適中的塊，放在一旁備用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先往鍋裡加入一些香辛料和卡比比草，煮出一鍋香辛料水，方便讓肉入味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再加入提鮮的樹果和蘑菇，煮幾分鐘後放入肉和馬鈴薯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把魚刮去鱗片，切開肚子，掏出不能食用的內臟。在流水中洗乾淨魚鰓，或是用小刀直接挖掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斜著在魚身上劃開口，把辣椒、胡椒、鹽、檸檬汁混合均勻，塗抹在魚身上……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用乾淨的樹枝串起來，插在篝火邊，注意時時轉動保證受熱均勻……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再回來看看燉肥鳥，等湯汁變得濃稠，加一點鹽調味，試試鹹淡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小火燉煮到香氣撲鼻……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這樣就算是做好了！把這鍋湯獻給大祭司吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們通常是怎麼吸引大祭司過來呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"唱歌！跳舞！歡慶！大吃特吃！大祭司自然就會被吸引來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那大家快一起吃吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，加入了蘑菇和樹果，整鍋湯的味道變得非常豐富，還帶有藥草的特殊香氣，是一鍋好湯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……好香……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"唱歌！跳舞！你們這樣乾愣著大祭司是不會來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇爾查克，先西，你們也都跳起來吧……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……大祭司還沒來嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"那可能需要用最後一招了，認真地呼喚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司大人，這裡有美食，請您過來吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克&萊歐斯&先西","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……大祭司大人，這裡有美食，請您過來吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚呃呃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"54_i3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解毒草肥鳥湯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕嘎嘎嘎嘎！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吸溜……姆……姆……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕咚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好溫暖的感覺……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好久沒有這麼舒舒服服地泡過澡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是這泡澡水裡奇奇怪怪的配料也太多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"切半的檸檬，切片的蘑菇，還有馬鈴薯塊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"甚至還有辣椒和卡比比草！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吸溜……姆……姆……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姆……呸呸呸！真難喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼藥浴嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊……但是，這種像是屁股被烤焦的感覺，讓人想起機甲每次發射前充滿駕駛艙的熱量，真是令人感到愜意啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡面泡一泡，爆炸帶來的勞累都一掃而空了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肥、肥鳥復活了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這肥鳥牠居然能在湯鍋中復原，難道說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊，這是“不會死去的魔物”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司！你怎麼在鍋裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司？！！這隻肥鳥就是大祭司？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃、嘔……那這湯其實就是牠的洗澡水吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔！我剛喝了一口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊啊，“不死的魔物”，好好奇牠的味道……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，在下就是大祭司！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的訴求我在泡澡時已經全部搞清楚了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你們的同伴中毒了，我絕對不會坐視不管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們好像沒說過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳！要解你們同伴中的毒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最好的辦法就是喝下這鍋藥浴裡的水！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝下這麼難喝的藥浴水，想必連瘋瘋癲癲的野狼都會清醒過來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難、難喝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一鍋湯要是難喝，一定是主要食材負最多的責任吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿達克利斯A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"既然大祭司發話了，那就請你們的同伴喝下有著大祭司祝福的熱湯吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好奇怪的熱湯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……呃……好吵……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，看來大祭司湯真的有用！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司……湯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"瑪露希爾努力地睜開眼睛——\n一隻會說話的魔物！還是活的！正在湯鍋裡不斷地品嚐著湯料，而面前碗中的湯正散發著和鍋裡同樣的香味。\n同時，萊歐斯已經拿著湯匙，眼疾手快地伸進鍋裡，舀出一匙，送進他自己的嘴裡。\n瑪露希爾咂了咂嘴後，終於彷彿回過神來一般尖叫出聲——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔、魔物？！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再也不要吃魔物了——！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，湯蠻香的耶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哈哈哈哈！小子，你的食物品味好差！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓！我知道你要問什麼！我大概明白是怎麼一回事了……嗯，原來如此，現在還不是時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦，沒什麼……你們要找羅德島是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找羅德島就對了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們走的方向沒錯！繼續走下去，一定沒問題！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊？又消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的意思是，我們走的方向是對的？啊……感覺是一句好沒有用的廢話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們到現在都沒有什麼方向啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，瑪露希爾，你究竟為什麼亂吃果子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……它長得很像木莓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"木莓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我和法琳第一次見面的時候，法琳給我吃過木莓，我在這裡看到了長得一模一樣的果子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為那個也是木莓呢，而且有小鳥在那裡吃，我就摘了兩個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之後就可以把這件事講給她聽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過因為食物中毒遇上了很多麻煩呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，囉嗦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我們繼續去找羅德島吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
